WEBVTT

1
00:00:04.516 --> 00:00:18.602
Classes are grouped from Year 1 to Year 6. Add a class with its name and school type.

2
00:00:18.602 --> 00:00:28.328
Paste the names straight from Excel, Google Sheets or WhatsApp. Numbers and bullets are removed.

3
00:00:28.328 --> 00:00:37.068
Now record PBD. Choose the date and the Learning Standard you assessed.

4
00:00:37.068 --> 00:00:53.712
Set everyone to the usual level, then change the few who differ. Tap a TP to see what it means.

5
00:00:53.712 --> 00:01:03.704
PBD progress shows a heatmap for the class, a suggested level and suggested groups.

6
00:01:03.704 --> 00:01:08.997
Export to Excel for your school records.

7
00:01:08.997 --> 00:01:11.400
Next: watch "Print, PDF and Word".
